@startuml UcChangePassword

title Authentication — ChangePasswordUseCase

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho

' ── Ports OUT ─────────────────────────────────
interface "LoadUserPort"       as LOAD #A5D6A7
interface "SaveUserPort"       as SAVE #A5D6A7
interface "PasswordEncoderPort" as ENC  #A5D6A7

component [UserAggregate]     as UA #FFF9C4
component [CredentialsVerifier] as CV #FFF9C4

' ══ ChangePasswordUseCase ════════════════════
package "ChangePasswordUseCase" #FFF3E0 {
    interface "ChangePasswordPort" as P_CHG
    component [ChangePasswordUseCase] as UC_CHG
    P_CHG ..|> UC_CHG
}

UC_CHG --> LOAD : findById(userId)
UC_CHG --> CV   : verifyCredentials(user, oldRaw, encoder)
UC_CHG --> ENC  : encode(newPassword)
UC_CHG --> UA   : changePassword(hashed)
UC_CHG --> SAVE : save(user)

note right of CV
  CredentialsVerifier (Domain Service):
  valida que la contraseña actual sea correcta
  antes de permitir el cambio
end note

@enduml

